<title>NETHERLANDS: EVC has 25 mln guilder 1996 net loss.</title>
<headline>EVC has 25 mln guilder 1996 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss per shr (gldrs)	   1.75 vs  11.20 profit</p>
<p>    Net loss				25.00 vs 163.9 profit</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.00 vs   3.00</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.09 vs   2.53</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.00 vs 176.5</p>
<p>NOTE - PVC maker EVC Int., minority-held by ICI and Enichem, said in August it had suffered a 7.8 million guilder loss in the 1996 first half and warned results were not expected to improve in the rest of the year.</p>
</text>
